# Pre-edit backups (the operating standard says back a file up before editing
# it). Suffixed forms too: `rt sync --write` writes TODO.md.bak-rtsync-<ts> on
# every run, and a CLAUDE.md.bak-rt203 reached a commit here before this rule.
*.bak
*.bak2
*.bak-*
*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime data — real customer QKView archives, DBs, local test inputs
